+---------------------------------------------+--------+------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Message Setting                             | Value  | Description                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------+--------+------------------------------------------------------------------+
| config_compile -design_size_maximum_warning | 100000 | Show a warning when total design instructions exceeds this value |
